{"id":31814,"date":"2025-08-17T01:53:05","date_gmt":"2025-08-17T01:53:05","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/dailyglobal.info\/trump-admin-agrees-to-allow-dc-police-chief-to-remain-in-charge-after-court-challenge\/"},"modified":"2025-08-17T01:53:05","modified_gmt":"2025-08-17T01:53:05","slug":"trump-admin-agrees-to-allow-dc-police-chief-to-remain-in-charge-after-court-challenge","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/dailyglobal.info\/trump-admin-agrees-to-allow-dc-police-chief-to-remain-in-charge-after-court-challenge\/","title":{"rendered":"Trump admin agrees to allow DC police chief to remain in charge after court challenge"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Attorney General Pam Bondi issued a new order Friday giving control of Washington, DC\u2019s Metropolitan Police Department back to Chief <!--more--> Pamela Smith, but it would still require the city to answer to the Trump administration for the time being. <\/p>\n<p>The new order comes after a hearing in federal court over a challenge to DEA Administrator Terrance Cole\u2019s appointment as \u201cemergency police commissioner\u201d a day earlier. The order replaces one issued Thursday evening appointing Cole and giving him full control of the department during the federal takeover. <\/p>\n<p>During the court hearing Friday afternoon, federal district Judge Ana Reyes encouraged the Justice Department and DC lawyers to work out a compromise addressing the effort to appoint new police leadership, so she wouldn\u2019t have to issue a direct ruling or temporary restraining order. <\/p>\n<p>Bondi\u2019s new order follows that guidance, clarifying that Cole has to go through Mayor Muriel Bowser in order to provide directions to the police department.<\/p>\n<p>CNN&#8217;s Victor Blackwell speaks with trial attorney Kelly Hyman. #CNN #News<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Attorney General Pam Bondi issued a new order Friday giving control of Washington, DC\u2019s Metropolitan Police Department bac